# Repository-root ignores.
#
# The Vite app lives in Dreadseer.github.io/ and has its own .gitignore, which
# only covers paths beneath that directory. Environment files sometimes end up
# here at the root instead, so they are ignored at this level too — secrets must
# never be committed regardless of which directory they land in.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules/
dist/
